stage3/measure: re-measurement of the instrumentation's cost outside the
S5..S20 window, from the RELEASED image (Stage 3 closure: G2 attempt 2 N1,
verifier advisory 4, G1-ruling review A-1/A-2, red team K5/K6/K8 constants).

Files
  mips32.py           MIPS32/Allegrex integer interpreter (delay slots,
                      branch-likely nullification, CP0 Count +1 per
                      executed instruction). Written for this closure; it
                      shares no code with handoff/impl/pathcount.py.
  measure.py          the scenarios (thread P08/P33, timer TICK/WD/WDP/T2D,
                      the thread-side hooks, the G3-low gap, the c_in->c_out
                      model for the K5 MMIO bound) on BASE and NEW
  measure-output.json raw results (python3 measure.py > measure-output.json)
  summary.py, SUMMARY.txt   the table DESIGN 18 and IMPLEMENTATION "Stage 3
                      closure" cite (python3 summary.py)
  thread-code-listing.txt   objdump excerpt of psp_joypad_thread (both
                      builds) for the statically counted thread code
  inputs.sha256       sha256 of the images and listings used

